From: hisamiii <265242552+hisamiii@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] loom: share a shim channel between two staged ingresses

LOOM_EXP_SHIM_SHARE=<rider>:<host>: a staged ingress rides on another's shim DMA channel (own descriptors, queued after the host's), as packets (host id 1, rider id 2) parted at the host's shim switch (arbiters 2 / 3), each master dropping the header. Frees a shim channel (the swap image's gate poll). Off by default.
